  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Assassin initiation reward (roadmap: assassin-quest), given by q_asn_finish with 1000 XP when the Sealed Writ is handed to Halmir. Mirrors the sibling prestige rewards' power tier (three +3-tier properties, no AB/damage -- forge-cap-safe), differentiated from the Shadowdancer boots (Hide/MS/Tumble already taken): Pick Pocket +3 (skill subtype 13), Open Lock +3 (skill subtype 9), Saving Throw Bonus vs Poison +3 (IP_CONST_SAVEVS_POISON = 13, verified in ovr/nwscript.nss). BaseItem 36 + ModelPart1 6 copied from the module's existing Ferny's Filching Gloves."
  },
  "Cost": {
    "type": "dword",
    "value": 0
  },
  "Cursed": {
    "type": "byte",
    "value": 0
  },
  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Thin gloves of grey kidskin, close as a second skin, that make no sound at all -- not on a latch, not on a purse-string, not on the haft of a knife. Halmir the Grey gave them over when the Sealed Writ was laid, still sealed, in his hand: the token of those the orders call Assassins, the quiet knives whose ledger is kept in Carn Dûm and read by no one. The hand that wears them was trusted once with its own death, and gave it back unopened."
    }
  },
